      ],
      "detail_description": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Invited by Empire Entertainment Japan, fromanother crafted the visuals for the Gotoh Island immersive room and developed the intricate visual assets of the Camellia flower — a symbol of elegance and enduring allure. Through 360 degree visual storytelling, the installation blurs the boundaries between reality and poetic imagination.",
